{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02493","headline":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得趣 · 令狐德棻","name":"冬日宴于庶子宅各赋一字得趣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高门聊命赏，羣英於此遇。\n放旷山水情，留连文酒趣。\n夕烟起林兰，霜枝殒庭树。\n落景虽已倾，归轩幸能驻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"令狐德棻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}